# Proxima cumulus - Quality
option.PROX_LOW_SAMPLES=Main Samples
option.PROX_LOW_SAMPLES.comment=Raymarch samples through the cloud layer. Higher = less noise and banding. Proxima default: 48.
option.PROX_LOW_SUNLIGHT_SAMPLES=Sunlight Samples
option.PROX_LOW_SUNLIGHT_SAMPLES.comment=Samples toward the sun for self-shadowing. Proxima default: 5.
option.PROX_LOW_SUNLIGHT_DETAIL_SAMPLES=Sunlight Detail Samples
option.PROX_LOW_SUNLIGHT_DETAIL_SAMPLES.comment=How many sunlight samples also use detail noise. Higher = sharper self-shadow details. Proxima default: 2.
option.PROX_LOW_SKYLIGHT_SAMPLES=Skylight Samples
option.PROX_LOW_SKYLIGHT_SAMPLES.comment=0 = Nubis ambient approximation (Proxima). >0 = marched skylight occlusion toward the zenith: darker, more volumetric cloud bases.
option.PROX_LOW_LIGHT_DISTANCE=Light March Distance
option.PROX_LOW_LIGHT_DISTANCE.comment=Sunlight ray length as a multiple of cloud thickness. Higher = neighbouring clouds cast shadows on each other. Raise Sunlight Samples too. Proxima default: 1.0.
option.PROX_LOW_DETAIL_DISTANCE=Detail Distance
suffix.PROX_LOW_DETAIL_DISTANCE= km
option.PROX_LOW_DETAIL_DISTANCE.comment=Detail noise is applied up to this distance. Very high values may shimmer far away. Proxima default: 12 km.
option.PROX_LOW_MAX_DISTANCE=Max Render Distance
suffix.PROX_LOW_MAX_DISTANCE= km
option.PROX_LOW_MAX_DISTANCE.comment=Maximum raymarch distance through the layer. Proxima default: 100 km.
option.PROX_LOW_MIN_TRANSMITTANCE=Min Transmittance
option.PROX_LOW_MIN_TRANSMITTANCE.comment=Raymarch stops below this transmittance. Lower = more accurate soft edges and dense cores. Proxima default: 0.05.
option.PROX_LOW_DEPTH_MODE=Cloud Depth Mode
value.PROX_LOW_DEPTH_MODE.0=Proxima
value.PROX_LOW_DEPTH_MODE.1=Hillaire (Revelation)
option.PROX_LOW_DEPTH_MODE.comment=Depth used for aerial perspective and temporal reprojection. Hillaire gives a more accurate depth = less ghosting with temporal upsampling.
option.PROX_SHADOW_DETAIL=Detailed Cloud Shadows
option.PROX_SHADOW_DETAIL.comment=Uses detail noise in the cloud shadow map. Off = Proxima.

