option.PROX_LOW_MS_COUNT=Multi-Scattering Octaves
option.PROX_LOW_MS_FALLOFF_S=MS Scattering Falloff
option.PROX_LOW_MS_FALLOFF_E=MS Extinction Falloff
option.PROX_LOW_MS_FALLOFF_P=MS Phase Falloff
option.PROX_LOW_POWDER=Powder Effect
option.PROX_LOW_POWDER.comment=In-scatter probability from Nubis: darker cloud edges facing the sun, brighter dense cores. Off = Proxima.
option.PROX_LOW_POWDER_STRENGTH=Powder Strength
option.PROX_LOW_NORMALIZE_LIGHT=Normalize Light Direction
option.PROX_LOW_NORMALIZE_LIGHT.comment=Fixes the dim light vector Proxima uses during the sun/moon switch at twilight. Off = Proxima.
option.PROX_LOW_SUN_MULT=Sunlight Multiplier
option.PROX_LOW_SKY_MULT=Skylight Multiplier
option.PROX_LOW_GROUND_MULT=Ground Bounce Multiplier
option.PROX_LOW_RAIN_DARKEN=Rain Darkening
option.PROX_LOW_SHADOW_DARKNESS=Self-Shadow Darkness
option.PROX_LOW_SHADOW_DARKNESS.comment=Multiplies the sunlight optical depth. Higher = darker cloud bases and stronger contrast. Proxima default: 1.0.
option.PROX_LOW_MS_ENERGY=Multi-Scattering Energy
option.PROX_LOW_MS_ENERGY.comment=How much light bounces inside the cloud. Lower = darker, more contrasty clouds. Proxima default: 1.0.
option.PROX_LOW_SKY_OCCLUSION=Skylight Occlusion
option.PROX_LOW_SKY_OCCLUSION.comment=Darkens skylight inside dense parts of the cloud. Higher = darker grey undersides. Proxima default: 1.0.
option.PROX_CU_BASE_NOISE_SCALE.comment=Frequency of the base shape noise. Higher = smaller, more broken cloud cells (does NOT make clouds darker). Proxima default: 1.0.
option.PROX_CU_DETAIL_NOISE_SCALE.comment=Frequency of the edge erosion noise. Higher = finer edge detail. Proxima default: 8.0.

